                 │
                 ▼
        ┌─────────────────┐
        │ Forensic Report │
        └────────┬────────┘
                 │
                 ▼
          📝 Scan History
```

##  Project Structure

```text
Email_Forensics_Tool/
│
├── main.py
├── email_parser.py
├── header_analyzer.py
├── threat_detector.py
├── report_generator.py
├── report_ui.py
├── ui_components.py
│
├── forensic_reports/
│
└── scan_history.json
```

### Core Components

| File                  | Description                                       |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| `main.py`             | Main entry point of the application               |
| `email_parser.py`     | Handles email parsing and information extraction  |
| `header_analyzer.py`  | Analyzes email headers                            |
| `threat_detector.py`  | Detects potential threats and phishing indicators |
| `report_generator.py` | Generates forensic analysis reports               |
| `report_ui.py`        | Handles the report-related interface              |
| `ui_components.py`    | Contains reusable UI components                   |

